{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello\nろってぃーに乃木坂１手が綺麗"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って誉められて上機嫌なmaayaです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は青森にてイベントしてきましたよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人がいてびっくりしたぁ〜来てくれた方有り難う〜遠いのにいつもの方とかも来てくれててこれまたびっくり〜＼(^o^)／ワーイ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方が盛り上げてくれて楽しいステージになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青森によんでもらえるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"又行きたいよ~＼(^^)／りんご美味しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、演出も凄かったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーの時には大量のシャボン玉が飛んだり、\n登場の時には、白いモクモク！\nスモーク？があったり、\n花火みたいなのが下から上がってきたり、楽しかった♪ヽ(´▽｀)/♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Zip! アナウンサーの桝さん♪)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかねぇ、齊籐の飛鳥が取扱い説明書書けって言うから嫌々書くね。。。\n笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケラケラッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか一緒に居すぎてツーショットとか撮ってない。許してwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齊籐飛鳥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥は前髪命の人です\n１分間に5回〜10回は直すよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに1ミリ単位！いや、1ミクロ単位\n鏡、クシ、リップ、手放しません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず前髪絶対触ったら駄目だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村のさゆりんごの横の触角つつくよりも怒っちゃうから要注意"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウヘヘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね、準備遅い！きっと将来飛鳥の旦那さんになる人は大変だろうな〜爆笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"拗ねたときはイチゴミルクを与えてあげてください。。。(*￣ー￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！お~い飛鳥ァァ！これでいいだろう？笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対怒るだろうなぁ〜ばらしちゃったぞォ(^w^)(^^)v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁねっ、でもね、本当にいい相棒だよ！こんなにも気が合う人いないってくらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいて気使わないし、楽しいし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分普段のまあや達を見た知らない人は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっ！？あの人達大丈夫か？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って本気でなるだろうなぁ〜(\"⌒∇⌒\")"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥と遊んだ日はよく寝れるんだよねぇ〜ずっとハイテンションだからかなぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっまだあった！\n飛鳥寝るの遅いのよ！ 夜寝る時とか電話してるんだけどねぇ、まあやが寝ちゃう( ・∇・)((o(￣ー￣)o))飛鳥の寝顔可愛いよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁねぇ〜飛鳥〜？もう書くことない！笑\nなんかねぇ、一緒に居すぎて何書いていいかわかんない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと飛鳥はこのblog見ながらニヤニヤしてるよー( ￣▽￣)イヒヒ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもヨロシクね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか飛鳥について質問ある人はなんかまあやに聞きにきなはれっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでも二年一緒にいてもあの子は謎の女だよ！よくわかんない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w\n以上！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(急に飛鳥が送ってきたw)\nケーキだらけの顔！手もベトベト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回も沢山のコメント有り難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの題名も沢山考えてくれて、ほんまにありがとう(///ω///)♪今回は一番最初にタイトル考えて下さった方のを採用させていただきましたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank You"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんからコメントがあった(／▽＼)♪嬉しい~"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもまいちゅんと連絡取ってるナウ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テヘッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ皆に質問！\nまいちゅんはの最近はまっていることは、どっちでしょうか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェめぐりor 半沢直樹\n以上！はやく、あの日見た花の名前を僕達はまだ知らない！の映画が見たいまあやでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっし！一緒に見に行くかっ！ポップコーンとジュースとチュロス買ってねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/08/9076549/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爆笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE (*^^*)"}],"source":"archive"}